exports[`OnboardingAside > совпадает со snapshot 1`] = `"<aside data-v-8e54a55f=""><span data-v-785de637="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="logotype"><span data-v-e2f44b48="" data-v-785de637="" class="transparent badge-container character aside-badge">C</span><span data-v-785de637="" class="logotype-text">Cogna</span></span><div data-v-8e54a55f="" class="aside-content"><span data-v-e2f44b48="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="transparent badge-container aside-badge ai-badge"><svg data-v-8e54a55f="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles w-3.5 h-3.5 ai-icon"><title>aiIcon</title><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z"></path><path d="M20 3v4"></path><path d="M22 5h-4"></path><path d="M4 17v2"></path><path d="M5 18H3"></path></svg> AI-powered подготовка к сессии</span><h1 data-v-8e54a55f="" class="title">Готовься умнее, <br data-v-8e54a55f=""> <span data-v-8e54a55f="" class="title-highlight">сдавай лучше</span></h1><p data-v-8e54a55f="" class="description">Cogna помогает студентам учить билеты по науке о памяти — интервальное повторение, активное вспоминание и AI-проверка ответов.</p><ul data-v-03ba8fd7="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="features-list"><li data-v-a7857d27="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="feature-item"><span data-v-e2f44b48="" data-v-3c132480="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="transparent badge-container feature-list-badge feature-item-icon"><svg data-v-b5827be9="" data-v-8e54a55f="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-book-open w-4 h-4 text-white icon"><title data-v-b5827be9="">book</title><path data-v-b5827be9="" d="M12 7v14"></path><path data-v-b5827be9="" d="M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"></path></svg></span><p data-v-e41df2f1="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="feature-item-title">Умные билеты</p><p data-v-0bd4f4db="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="feature-item-description">Создавай структурированные конспекты с формулами, схемами и таблицами</p></li><li data-v-a7857d27="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="feature-item"><span data-v-e2f44b48="" data-v-3c132480="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="transparent badge-container feature-list-badge feature-item-icon"><svg data-v-8e54a55f="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-brain w-4 h-4 text-white icon"><title>brain</title><path d="M12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.997.125 4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 0 .556 6.588A4 4 0 1 0 12 18Z"></path><path d="M12 5a3 3 0 1 1 5.997.125 4 4 0 0 1 2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 1-.556 6.588A4 4 0 1 1 12 18Z"></path><path d="M15 13a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3-4 4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3 4"></path><path d="M17.599 6.5a3 3 0 0 0 .399-1.375"></path><path d="M6.003 5.125A3 3 0 0 0 6.401 6.5"></path><path d="M3.477 10.896a4 4 0 0 1 .585-.396"></path><path d="M19.938 10.5a4 4 0 0 1 .585.396"></path><path d="M6 18a4 4 0 0 1-1.967-.516"></path><path d="M19.967 17.484A4 4 0 0 1 18 18"></path></svg></span><p data-v-e41df2f1="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="feature-item-title">AI-проверка</p><p data-v-0bd4f4db="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="feature-item-description">Нейросеть анализирует твой ответ и указывает на пробелы</p></li><li data-v-a7857d27="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="feature-item"><span data-v-e2f44b48="" data-v-3c132480="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="transparent badge-container feature-list-badge feature-item-icon"><svg data-v-8e54a55f="" aria="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up w-4 h-4 text-white icon"><title>trending</title><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"></polyline><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"></polyline></svg></span><p data-v-e41df2f1="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="feature-item-title">Интервальное повторение</p><p data-v-0bd4f4db="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="feature-item-description">Алгоритм напоминает о билетах в момент, когда они начинают забываться</p></li></ul><span data-v-e2f44b48="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="transparent badge-container aside-badge users-rating"><div data-v-8e54a55f="" data-slot="root" class="inline-flex flex-row-reverse justify-end users-list"><!--v-if--><span data-v-8e54a55f="" data-slot="root" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 select-none align-middle bg-elevated size-8 text-base relative rounded-full ring-bg first:me-0 ring-2 -me-1.5"><img src="https://github.com/noook.png" alt="Neil Richter" width="32" height="32" data-slot="image" class="h-full w-full rounded-[inherit] object-cover"></span><span data-v-8e54a55f="" data-slot="root" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 select-none align-middle bg-elevated size-8 text-base relative rounded-full ring-bg first:me-0 ring-2 -me-1.5"><img src="https://github.com/noook.png" alt="Neil Richter" width="32" height="32" data-slot="image" class="h-full w-full rounded-[inherit] object-cover"></span><span data-v-8e54a55f="" data-slot="root" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 select-none align-middle bg-elevated size-8 text-base relative rounded-full ring-bg first:me-0 ring-2 -me-1.5"><img src="https://github.com/romhml.png" alt="Romain Hamel" width="32" height="32" data-slot="image" class="h-full w-full rounded-[inherit] object-cover"></span><span data-v-8e54a55f="" data-slot="root" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 select-none align-middle bg-elevated size-8 text-base relative rounded-full ring-bg first:me-0 ring-2 -me-1.5"><img src="https://github.com/benjamincanac.png" alt="Benjamin Canac" width="32" height="32" data-slot="image" class="h-full w-full rounded-[inherit] object-cover"></span></div><p data-v-8e54a55f="" class="bold">12 000+ студентов</p><p data-v-8e54a55f="">уже готовятся с Cogna</p></span></div></aside>"`;
